<title>SINGAPORE: Asia Food sees 50 mln shares sold.</title>
<headline>Asia Food sees 50 mln shares sold.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-07-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Flambo International Ltd said on Wednesday it had sold 50 million of Asia Food &amp; Properties (AFP) shares on Tuesday.</p>
<p>After the sale, Flambo holds 2.14 billion AFP shares.</p>
<p>Flambo said in a statement the Indonesian Widjaya family trust had a deemed interest in the remaining 2.14 billion AFP shares.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703080)</p>
